Outcome A: full GPU verification.
Model GPU weight upload, data conversion, device memory ownership, synchronization, kernel forward behavior, GPU error handling, CPU/GPU state-version synchronization, and numerical equivalence. Prove a CPU/GPU equivalence theorem with an explicit f32 tolerance bound and explicit preconditions.

