- magic bytes;
- version;
- dimensions;
- layer count;
- configuration fields;
- gradient-mean flag;
- clip values;
- all tensor ranks;
- all tensor dimensions;
- every f32 data bit pattern;
- checksum algorithm;
- temporary file and replacement behavior if it is inside the verification boundary;
- malformed input behavior;
- trailing-data policy.

